<p dir="auto">We're adding <code class="notranslate">loading=lazy</code> to <code class="notranslate">&lt;audio&gt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">&lt;video&gt;</code> attributes!</p>
<p dir="auto">Coming to Chrome in 147 (behind a flag): <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456</a></p>
