<p dir="auto">Unlike <code class="notranslate">:active-view-transition-type(&lt;custom-ident&gt;#)</code>, the <code class="notranslate">types</code> descriptor for <code class="notranslate">@view-transition</code> takes values <code class="notranslate">none | &lt;custom-ident&gt;+</code>. The <code class="notranslate">types</code> values should be space separated.</p>
