<h2 dir="auto">Motivation</h2>
<p dir="auto">The js-types proposal adds <code class="notranslate">type()</code> methods to Memory, Table, and Global, but only <code class="notranslate">Tag.type()</code> is currently documented on MDN. The issue notes these methods are implemented in Safari and meet MDN's documentation criteria.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #41157.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3421949146" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41157" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41157/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41157">#41157</a>.</p>
